{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52631","headline":"赠崔沔 · 崔日用","name":"赠崔沔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"接閈共怀铅，齐生俎贲玉。\n（见《文苑英华》卷七○二崔佑甫《齐昭公崔府君集序》引）（按：崔佑甫文称爲「赠佑甫先君左仆射」诗，系以佑甫身份而言，非日用诗题。\n今另拟题。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔日用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}